# The functions browser shows a legend of the available actions.
NAME=functions browser shows the action legend
FILE=malloc://128
ARGS=-a x86 -b 64 -c "wx 554889e5897dfc8b07c3"
COLS=80
ROWS=24
STEPS=<<STEPEOF
KEYS Vv<ENTER>
WAIT 400
EXPECT_REGEX \(a\) analyze \(-\) delete \(x\) xrefs to \(X\) xrefs from
EXPECT_REGEX \(r\) rename \(c\) calls \(d\) define \(:\) shell \(v\) vars
EXPECT_REGEX \(j/k\) next/prev \(tab\) column \(_\) hud \(\?\) help
EXPECT_REGEX \(f/F\) set/reset filter \(s\) function signature \(q\) quit
EXPECT_REGEX \(=\) show/hide legend \(h/l\) short/full function name
QUIT
STEPEOF
